z(3,'text','An ordinary guest kernel panic can be contained without crashing other guests','Scope isolation to intended failure containment.',option=1)
z(3,'explanation','Each guest has a separate kernel. Shared-host failures and hypervisor vulnerabilities remain outside that normal containment assumption.','Qualify boundary.',option=1)
